      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# Dynamic linking\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Dynamic linking"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "FileTree, Maintenance and the optional Qt facade and presentation libraries are\nshared targets. iOS configurations use frameworks and WebAssembly uses side\nmodules. FileTree explicitly links the file provider's temporary lease library;\napplications bundle it together with the other required provider libraries.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "The Emscripten package configuration enables CMake shared-library imports for side modules. The builder or application must supply the main-module compile and link options.\n"
    }
  ],
